[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-university-of-trieste-scholarship-2026-in-italy-application-requirements-213":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},213,"university-of-trieste-scholarship-2026-in-italy-application-requirements-213","University Of Trieste Scholarship 2026 In Italy: Application Requirements","\u003Cp>The University of Trieste Scholarship offers a €16,243 grant and p to 50% increase in stipend for research for international students to pursue graduate degrees in Europe.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Trieste Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: University of Trieste\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-europe\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-Europe\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Italy\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fphd-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">PhD Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Research Grants\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>€16,243 Grant\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 25, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Trieste Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Applications are now being accepted for University of Trieste Scholarship 2026.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>These University of Trieste Scholarships span across a variety of cutting-edge departments, offering a unique opportunity to engage in advanced research while experiencing the rich culture and vibrant academic environment of Italy.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>All qualified and interested international students are encouraged to apply.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>University of Trieste Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Trieste Scholarship offers:\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Annual Stipend:\u003C\u002Fstrong> €16,243 (gross of national insurance contributions), paid in monthly installments.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Research Abroad:\u003C\u002Fstrong> Up to 50% increase in stipend for research conducted abroad for at least 60 uninterrupted days.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Industry Collaboration:\u003C\u002Fstrong> Opportunities for practical experience with industry partners.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Research Support:\u003C\u002Fstrong> Additional resources for industry-aligned research projects.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Trieste Scholarship 2026 Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the University of Trieste Scholarship 2026, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>possess a bachelor’s degree in related field\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>meet the entry requirements of the University of Trieste\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>apply before the deadline\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>PhD scholarships are assigned based on a comparative evaluation of merit and following the ranking order.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Where two or more candidates score the same in the selection process, the one with the lowest family income (known as ISEE) will get preference.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarships cannot be granted to students who have been awarded a doctoral scholarship before, even partially, and cannot be combined with other grants. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Along with the ordinary scholarships, a doctoral Programme may offer scholarships funded by the European Union or other international bodies. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Available Programs for University of Trieste Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply, candidates must be ready to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Environmental Life Sciences\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applied Data Science and Artificial Intelligence\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Molecular Biomedicine\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Chemistry\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Circular Economy\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Physics\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Civil-Environmental Engineering and Architecture\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Industrial and Information Engineering\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Personalized Medicine and Innovative Therapies\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Nanotechnology\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Neural and Cognitive Sciences\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Earth science, fluid-dynamics and mathematics. Interactions and methods\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>History, Philosophy and Political-Social Studies (SPHIPOL)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for University of Trieste Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the University of Trieste Scholarship 2026, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on your desired programs and proceed to its website\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fportale.units.it\u002Fen\u002Fresearch\u002Fphd\u002Fscholarships\">https:\u002F\u002Fportale.units.it\u002Fen\u002Fresearch\u002Fphd\u002Fscholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-05-05 16:50:57",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funiversity-of-trieste-scholarship-2026-in-italy-application-requirements\u002F69fa11e10d1bc0.98779534_screenshot 2026-05-05 164448.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funiversity-of-trieste-scholarship-2026-in-italy-application-requirements\u002F69fa11e10d1bc0.98779534_screenshot%202026-05-05%20164448.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmo